ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja479:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:10.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:10.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja479:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:11.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:11.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja479:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja479:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja479:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja479:15.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:15.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:15.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:15.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja479:16.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:16.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:16.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja479:16.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja479:17.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja479:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja479:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja479:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja479:0.4": "6. Kāliṅgabodhijātaka ", "ja479:1.1": "Rājā kāliṅgo cakkavatti, ", "ja479:1.2": "Dhammena pathavimanusāsaṁ; ", "ja479:1.3": "Agamā bodhisamīpaṁ, ", "ja479:1.4": "Nāgena mahānubhāvena. ", "ja479:2.1": "Kāliṅgo bhāradvājo ca, ", "ja479:2.2": "Rājānaṁ kāliṅgaṁ samaṇakolaññaṁ; ", "ja479:2.3": "Cakkaṁ vattayato pariggahetvā, ", "ja479:2.4": "Pañjalī idamavoca. ", "ja479:3.1": "“Paccoroha mahārāja, ", "ja479:3.2": "Bhūmibhāgo yathā samaṇuggato; ", "ja479:3.3": "Idha anadhivarā buddhā, ", "ja479:3.4": "Abhisambuddhā virocanti. ", "ja479:4.1": "Padakkhiṇato āvaṭṭā, ", "ja479:4.2": "Tiṇalatā asmiṁ bhūmibhāgasmiṁ; ", "ja479:4.3": "Pathaviyā nābhiyaṁ maṇḍo, ", "ja479:4.4": "Iti no sutaṁ mante mahārāja. ", "ja479:5.1": "Sāgarapariyantāya, ", "ja479:5.2": "Mediniyā sabbabhūtadharaṇiyā; ", "ja479:5.3": "Pathaviyā ayaṁ maṇḍo, ", "ja479:5.4": "Orohitvā namo karohi. ", "ja479:6.1": "Ye te bhavanti nāgā ca, ", "ja479:6.2": "abhijātā ca kuñjarā; ", "ja479:6.3": "Ettāvatā padesaṁ te, ", "ja479:6.4": "nāgā neva mupayanti. ", "ja479:7.1": "Abhijāto nāgo kāmaṁ, ", "ja479:7.2": "Pesehi kuñjaraṁ dantiṁ; ", "ja479:7.3": "Ettāvatā padeso, ", "ja479:7.4": "Sakkā nāgena mupagantuṁ. ", "ja479:8.1": "Taṁ sutvā rājā kāliṅgo, ", "ja479:8.2": "Veyyañjanikavaco nisāmetvā; ", "ja479:8.3": "Sampesesi nāgaṁ ñassāma, ", "ja479:8.4": "Mayaṁ yathimassidaṁ vacanaṁ”. ", "ja479:9.1": "Sampesito ca raññā, ", "ja479:9.2": "Nāgo koñcova abhinaditvāna; ", "ja479:9.3": "Paṭisakkitvā nisīdi, ", "ja479:9.4": "Garuṁva bhāraṁ asahamāno. ", "ja479:10.1": "Kāliṅgabhāradvājo, ", "ja479:10.2": "Nāgaṁ khīṇāyukaṁ viditvāna; ", "ja479:10.3": "Rājānaṁ kāliṅgaṁ, ", "ja479:10.4": "Taramāno ajjhabhāsittha; ", "ja479:10.5": "“Aññaṁ saṅkama nāgaṁ, ", "ja479:10.6": "Nāgo khīṇāyuko mahārāja”. ", "ja479:11.1": "Taṁ sutvā kāliṅgo, ", "ja479:11.2": "taramāno saṅkamī nāgaṁ; ", "ja479:11.3": "Saṅkanteva raññe, ", "ja479:11.4": "nāgo tattheva pati bhumyā; ", "ja479:11.5": "Veyyañjanikavaco, ", "ja479:11.6": "yathā tathā ahu nāgo. ", "ja479:12.1": "Kāliṅgo rājā kāliṅgaṁ, ", "ja479:12.2": "brāhmaṇaṁ etadavoca; ", "ja479:12.3": "“Tvameva asi sambuddho, ", "ja479:12.4": "sabbaññū sabbadassāvī”. ", "ja479:13.1": "Taṁ anadhivāsento kāliṅgaṁ, ", "ja479:13.2": "Brāhmaṇo idamavoca; ", "ja479:13.3": "“Veyyañjanikā hi mayaṁ, ", "ja479:13.4": "Buddhā sabbaññuno mahārāja. ", "ja479:14.1": "Sabbaññū sabbavidū ca, ", "ja479:14.2": "Buddhā na lakkhaṇena jānanti; ", "ja479:14.3": "Āgamabalasā hi mayaṁ, ", "ja479:14.4": "Buddhā sabbaṁ pajānanti”. ", "ja479:15.1": "Mahayitvā sambodhiṁ, ", "ja479:15.2": "Nānāturiyehi vajjamānehi; ", "ja479:15.3": "Mālāvilepanaṁ abhiharitvā, ", "ja479:15.4": "Atha rājā manupāyāsi. ", "ja479:16.1": "Saṭṭhi vāhasahassāni, ", "ja479:16.2": "pupphānaṁ sannipātayi; ", "ja479:16.3": "Pūjesi rājā kāliṅgo, ", "ja479:16.4": "bodhimaṇḍamanuttaranti. ", "ja479:17.1": "Kāliṅgabodhijātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja479:0.1": "", "ja479:0.2": "", "ja479:0.3": "", "ja479:0.4": "", "ja479:1.1": "", "ja479:1.2": "pathavimanusāsaṁ → … manusāsi (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja479:1.3": "Agamā → agamāsi (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja479:1.4": "", "ja479:2.1": "", "ja479:2.2": "", "ja479:2.3": "pariggahetvā → pariṇetvā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:2.4": "", "ja479:3.1": "", "ja479:3.2": "samaṇuggato → samanugīto (bj, pts-vp-pli1); samaṇugīto (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja479:3.3": "", "ja479:3.4": "", "ja479:4.1": "", "ja479:4.2": "", "ja479:4.3": "Pathaviyā nābhiyaṁ → puthuviyā ayaṁ (bj); paṭhaviyā ayaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); puthaviyā'yaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:4.4": "sutaṁ mante mahārāja → sutaṁ mahārāja (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:5.1": "", "ja479:5.2": "", "ja479:5.3": "", "ja479:5.4": "", "ja479:6.1": "", "ja479:6.2": "", "ja479:6.3": "", "ja479:6.4": "", "ja479:7.1": "Abhijāto nāgo → abhijāto te nāgo (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:7.2": "", "ja479:7.3": "padeso → padeso ca (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja479:7.4": "Sakkā → na sakkā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja479:8.1": "Taṁ → taṁ vacanaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) | kāliṅgaṁ → kāliṅgo (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); kaliṅga (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:8.2": "", "ja479:8.3": "", "ja479:8.4": "yathimassidaṁ → yathā idaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:9.1": "", "ja479:9.2": "", "ja479:9.3": "Paṭisakkitvā → paṭiosakkitvā (mr) ", "ja479:9.4": "", "ja479:10.1": "", "ja479:10.2": "", "ja479:10.3": "", "ja479:10.4": "", "ja479:10.5": "", "ja479:10.6": "", "ja479:11.1": "", "ja479:11.2": "", "ja479:11.3": "", "ja479:11.4": "pati → patito (mr) ", "ja479:11.5": "", "ja479:11.6": "", "ja479:12.1": "", "ja479:12.2": "", "ja479:12.3": "", "ja479:12.4": "", "ja479:13.1": "", "ja479:13.2": "", "ja479:13.3": "", "ja479:13.4": "", "ja479:14.1": "", "ja479:14.2": "", "ja479:14.3": "Āgamabalasā → āgamapurisā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:14.4": "", "ja479:15.1": "Mahayitvā sambodhiṁ → mahāyitvāna sambodhiṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); pahaṁsitvāna sambodhiṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); mamāyitvāna taṁ bodhiṁ (mr) ", "ja479:15.2": "", "ja479:15.3": "Mālāvilepanaṁ abhiharitvā → mālāgandhavilepanaṁ āharitvā (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja479:15.4": "Atha rājā manupāyāsi → pākāraparikkhepaṁ kāresi (si); pākāraparikkhepaṁ kāresi. atha rājā pāyāsi (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts1ed) ", "ja479:16.1": "", "ja479:16.2": "", "ja479:16.3": "", "ja479:16.4": "bodhimaṇḍamanuttaranti → … varuttameti (bj) ", "ja479:17.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja479:0.1": "", "ja479:0.2": "", "ja479:0.3": "", "ja479:0.4": "", "ja479:1.1": "bj30.456, dr27.351, ms22J_2455, msdiv67, pts-vp-pli4.232, sya27.352", "ja479:1.2": "", "ja479:1.3": "", "ja479:1.4": "", "ja479:2.1": "ms22J_2456, msdiv68, pts-vp-pli4.233", "ja479:2.2": "", "ja479:2.3": "", "ja479:2.4": "", "ja479:3.1": "ms22J_2457, msdiv69, ndp22.257", "ja479:3.2": "", "ja479:3.3": "", "ja479:3.4": "", "ja479:4.1": "csp1ed22.265, csp2ed22.265, ms22J_2458, msdiv70", "ja479:4.2": "", "ja479:4.3": "", "ja479:4.4": "", "ja479:5.1": "ms22J_2459, msdiv71", "ja479:5.2": "", "ja479:5.3": "", "ja479:5.4": "", "ja479:6.1": "ms22J_2460, msdiv72", "ja479:6.